правила входа от модели: новых 5, отвергнуто формой 0
since_signal >= 0.03 и buy_share <= 0.47, окно 4 ч — Short entry after the price has already squeezed up since the signal and taker buying has faded. This catches the 'against_then_for' shape (MAE around 3h) after the adverse move is spent, so the entry is higher and the floor is further away.
crowd_bybit_shift <= -0.06 и px_1h >= 0.005, окно 4 ч — Shorts on Bybit have been covering (the crowd shifted long) while price rose. This marks a short squeeze that has already happened; the forced buying is done, leaving a better price to short with less squeeze fuel left.
oi_1h <= -0.02 и since_signal >= 0.01, окно 5 ч — Open interest is unwinding during a rise after the signal. The rally is driven by liquidations or covering rather than new longs, so it tends to exhaust; entering after the unwind avoids the straight_against paths.
burst_ratio >= 2 и depth_eat_ask >= 1000 и px_1h >= 0.01, окно 3 ч — A burst of aggressive buying that ate through ask depth and lifted the price for an hour. This is a buying climax where exhaustion is likely, so shorting into it gives a better fill than entering at the signal.
funding >= 0.0001 и since_signal >= 0, окно 6 ч — Funding has turned positive and longs are paying while the price is at or above the signal price. Longs are getting crowded, and a short collects funding and gets in at a no-worse price than the signal.
модель: These rules target the adverse excursion that comes before favourable moves: the against_then_for paths have a median MAE of about 7% at about 3h. Wait-for-squeeze conditions use since_signal, px_1h, positioning, open-interest and flow exhaustion. They avoid the btc_1h, px_24h and buy_share/depth_eat_bid grid pairs that were already in the last search.
